  "kind": "Complex",
  "description": "Three story apartment building, ground floor should have a store, with shelves and display window(s). Stairway up that starts from \u0022inside\u0022 the building. The aparments themselves should be identical room-wise for the floors above the shop and contain everything expected from an aparment, toilet, shower/batch, kitchen, bed, etc...\r\n\r\nThe apartment building should look like a slightly ran down NY apartment building from the outside.",
